B. Material derived from other projects
=======================================

The following material is derived from other projects and is distributed
under the license of the directory that contains it (LICENSING.md).

1. circomlib sparse Merkle tree templates
   File: circuit-primitives/src/smt.rs (lev_ins_flag, processor_sm,
   processor_level, verify_transition, verify_inclusion), a Rust port of
   circuits/smt/smtlevins.circom, smtprocessor.circom,
   smtprocessorsm.circom, smtprocessorlevel.circom and smtverifier.circom.
   Source: https://github.com/iden3/circomlib
   Original work Copyright 2018 0KIMS association.

2. davinci-node and other Vocdoni projects
   Several modules are ported from, or are bit-compatible with, Vocdoni
   projects: davinci-node (Chaum-Pedersen verification, ElGamal ballot
   arithmetic, protocol parameters), arbo, lean-imt-go,
   gnark-crypto-primitives and davinci-circom (the ballot proof
   verification key in rust-sdk/assets/ballot_proof_vkey.json).


